## 1. Project Overview

**Setu Connect** ek WhatsApp-jaise real-time secure chat application hai jo enterprise teams ke liye bani hai. Yeh app regular messaging ke saath AI-powered features deti hai jaise chat summarization, smart replies, grammar correction, message translation, aur bahut kuch.

### 1.1 App Name & Identity
- **Product Name:** Setu Connect
- **Internal Code Name:** `whatsapp-clone`
- **Project Type:** Full-Stack Web Application
- **Category:** Enterprise Real-Time Messaging + AI

### 1.2 Core Problem It Solves
| Problem | Solution |
|---|---|
| Corporate chats leak to external AI APIs (OpenAI, etc.) | Local/Gemini AI provider with privacy controls |
| No audit trail for calls & messages | Full call history + analytics dashboard |
| High cloud LLM API costs | Multi-provider AI (Device → Ollama → Gemini fallback) |
| No end-to-end encryption in team apps | AES-256 client-side message encryption |

### 1.3 Live URLs
- **Frontend (Vercel):** `https://internship-project-xi.vercel.app`
- **Backend (Render):** `https://internship-project-mywr.onrender.com`
- **Local Dev Frontend:** `http://localhost:5173`
- **Local Dev Backend:** `http://localhost:8081`

