3rd → Gemini 1.5 Flash (Google Cloud) — CLOUD, requires API key
```

> **⚠️ Important Change (v2.0):** Pehle Ollama primary provider tha aur required tha. Ab yeh optional hai.
> System **AUTO mode** mein chalega. Agar koi local provider available nahi hai, toh **Gemini API** use hogi (cloud mode).
> App Ollama ke bina bhi fully functional hai.

