## 7. WebSocket Real-Time Flows

### 7.1 Connection Setup
```
URL: ws://backend-host/ws (SockJS fallback)
Protocol: STOMP over SockJS

On connect, frontend subscribes to:
  /topic/messages/{myUsername}      → incoming messages
  /topic/typing/{myUsername}        → typing indicators
  /topic/calls/{myUsername}         → WebRTC call signals
  /topic/callhistory/{myUsername}   → real-time call log updates
  /topic/messages/read/{myUsername} → blue tick read receipts
```

### 7.2 Send a Message (WebSocket)
```
Frontend PUBLISH → /app/chat
Payload:
{
  senderUsername, receiverUsername, content (encrypted),
  groupId (null for direct), messageType, isMedia, mediaUrl,
  mediaType, iv (AES IV), selfDestructSeconds, isPriority,
  parentMessageId, isForwarded
}
    ↓
Backend MessageController.processMessage()
    ↓ MessageService.saveMessage() → PostgreSQL
    ↓
If GROUP:
  BROADCAST → /topic/messages/{each member's username}
If DIRECT:
  BROADCAST → /topic/messages/{receiverUsername}
  BROADCAST → /topic/messages/{senderUsername}   ← UI confirmation
```

### 7.3 Typing Indicator (WebSocket)
```
Frontend PUBLISH → /app/chat/typing
{ senderUsername, receiverUsername, isTyping: true/false }
    ↓
BROADCAST → /topic/typing/{receiverUsername}
```

### 7.4 WebRTC Call Signaling (WebSocket)
```
Caller PUBLISH → /app/call/signal
{ type: "call-request|offer|answer|candidate|call-end",
  callerUsername, receiverUsername, sdp, candidate }
    ↓
BROADCAST → /topic/calls/{receiverUsername}
```

### 7.5 Read Receipt (REST → WebSocket)
```
Frontend POST → /api/messages/read/{senderUsername}
    ↓ DB: updates status = "read"
    ↓
BROADCAST → /topic/messages/read/{senderUsername}
  { senderUsername, receiverUsername }
  (sender's UI changes grey double ticks → blue double ticks)
```

### 7.6 Presence (Online Status)
```
On WS connect:
Frontend PUBLISH → /app/presence/connect
Body: myUsername

Backend PresenceService.userOnline(username, sessionId)
(stored in ConcurrentHashMap — session-based)

On disconnect: PresenceService.userOffline(sessionId)

Poll: GET /api/users/online → returns Set<String> of online usernames
```

