## 8. AI System Architecture

### 8.1 Provider Selection Flow (AiProviderManager)
```
Request arrives at AiController
    ↓
AiService.executeWithReport(promptText)
    ↓
AiProviderManager.selectProvider()
    ↓ reads AiSettings from DB (singleton record id=1)

┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ preferredProvider = "DEVICE" → DeviceAiProvider  │
│ preferredProvider = "LOCAL"  → OllamaAiProvider  │
│ preferredProvider = "CLOUD"  → GeminiAiProvider  │
│                               (if not disabled)  │
│                                                  │
│ preferredProvider = "AUTO" (DEFAULT):             │
│   Step 1: DeviceAiProvider.isAvailable()? ─Yes─▶ Use Device │
│                    │No                           │
│   Step 2: OllamaAiProvider.isAvailable()? ─Yes─▶ Use Ollama │
│           (pings http://localhost:11434)          │
│                    │No                           │
│   Step 3: GeminiAiProvider.isAvailable()? ─Yes─▶ Use Gemini │
│           (checks if gemini.api.key is set)       │
│                    │No                           │
│   All failed → return null → "AI Unavailable"    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

