### 14.2 User Flows to Prototype

**Flow 1: Onboarding → First Message**
```
Auth Screen → Register → Main App → Empty state "Add a contact" 
→ Click "+" → Search by phone → User found → Add Contact 
→ Contact appears in list → Click → Chat opens → Type → Send
→ Message bubble appears → Grey single tick
```

**Flow 2: AI Summarize**
```
Open chat with messages → Click AI icon (sparkle icon in header)
→ AI Panel slides up showing 16 feature cards
→ Click "Summarize Chat" → Privacy notice popup (if cloud)
→ Click Allow → Loading spinner → 
→ Response shown: "• Summary: ...\n• Key Points: ...\n• Decisions: ..."
→ Privacy card: "Provider: Gemini | Cloud | Data Sent: Yes | 2.3s"
```

**Flow 3: Voice Call**
```
Open chat → Click phone icon in header
→ "Calling alice..." screen
→ [Other device] Incoming call overlay → Accept
→ Call connected → Timer starts → AudioCallWindow
→ End → "Audio Call • 2:25" system message in chat
```

### 14.3 Animation Specs for Prototype
| Interaction | Animation |
|---|---|
| Modal open | Scale from 0.95→1.0 + fade in, 350ms ease |
| Message send | Slide in from right (sent) / left (received), 200ms |
| AI panel open | Slide up from bottom, 350ms ease |
| Tab switch | Cross-fade content, 200ms |
| Incoming call | Fade in + avatar ring pulse |
| Hover: list item | Background `rgba(255,255,255,0.05)`, 200ms |
| Hover: button | `translateY(-1px)`, 200ms |
| Typing indicator | 3-dot bounce (dot1→dot2→dot3 staggered) |
| Unread badge | Pop scale from 0→1, bounce |

